    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean doctors always make everything sound so scary and expensive lol. if i just try to take it easy and maybe take some electrolytes or vitamins to help with the fatigue, do you think that would settle it down? like is there any way i can just manage this at home for a week and see if it goes away on its own before i go through all that trouble?",
