      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your concern, but relying solely on self-care without professional evaluation and guidance can be misleading. Electrolytes and vitamins may provide temporary relief for fatigue, but they won't address the underlying causes of your symptoms like POTS or an inflammatory response. Ignoring your symptoms or waiting for them to resolve could lead to more severe complications or misdiagnosis of another condition. Medical professionals can provide personalized guidance, diagnose underlying conditions, and develop effective treatment plans to address your symptoms.",
